title: AiMatchResult (MF-03)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> PENDING : application created / HR retries
  PENDING --> PROCESSING : dispatcher sends to AI service
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : AI callback with score and tier
  PROCESSING --> PENDING : transient error, retry with back-off
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : retries exhausted / invalid CV text
  FAILED --> [*] : HR retry creates a new attempt
  COMPLETED --> [*]
